  "claims": [
    {
      "statement_id": "p-method",
      "text": "学習済みの共有hidden stateとmask embeddingを使い、複数draft tokenを一回のforward passで提案する。採否を決めるtarget modelの検証は残る。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-blog",
        "peagle-paper-v1"
      ],
      "context": "paper §2; blog Our Approach / Implementation"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "p-training",
      "text": "並列予測専用のdrafterが必要。論文は長系列学習のattention mask事前計算と、依存関係を保つ系列内分割でメモリ負荷に対応する。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-paper-v1"
      ],
      "context": "§2–3; training is not free or removed"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "p-blog-setup",
      "text": "報告の評価はGPT-OSS 20B、B200 1基、vLLM、4層drafter。両手法ともlinear draftingでK=3/5/7を掃引し、各条件でそれぞれ最大TPSのKを選ぶ。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-blog"
      ],
      "context": "vLLM Benchmarking; concurrency 1/2/4/8/16/32/64; MT-Bench/HumanEval/SPEED-Bench Code"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "p-config",
      "text": "掲載設定はfp8 KV cache、async schedulingを使用し、prefix cachingとchunked prefillを無効にする。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-blog"
      ],
      "context": "benchmark launch command; recipe-specific, not general requirements"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "p-integration",
      "text": "報告はvLLM v0.16.0からの統合と対応学習済みheadを案内する一方、GPT-OSS 20BでEAGLE drafterをserveするにはPR #36684のpatchが必要としている。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-blog"
      ],
      "context": "opening / benchmark Note; captured page statement, not verified release history"
    },
    {
      "statement_id": "p-paper-setup",
      "text": "論文のserving表はH200 1基、concurrency 2/4、3種のtargetと異なるbenchmark条件でAR EAGLE-3と比較する。baselineにはHCA lossも用いる。",
      "subject_id": "peagle",
      "subject_role": "PRIMARY_SUBJECT",
      "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
      "source_ids": [
        "peagle-paper-v1"
      ],
      "context": "§5.1–5.3, Table 10; no conflation with March blog"
